      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.304,
          "end": 3.137,
          "en": "[Maximilian Schwarzmüller] Great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.137,
          "end": 5,
          "en": "So, now we added this save area view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5,
          "end": 7.11,
          "en": "Let's now continue with styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.11,
          "end": 10.67,
          "en": "and laying out the rest of this game screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.67,
          "end": 13.07,
          "en": "And this opponents guest text, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.07,
          "end": 14.96,
          "en": "should be a title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 14.96,
          "end": 17.683,
          "en": "Not a small little text as we have it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.81,
          "end": 21.923,
          "en": "And to make it a title we can add some extra styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.13,
          "end": 27.849,
          "en": "For this, I'll add a title property here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.849,
          "end": 29.96,
          "en": "And then we could say that a title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.96,
          "end": 33.05,
          "en": "should have a font size of 18 maybe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.05,
          "end": 35.53,
          "en": "maybe it should have a font weight of bold,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.53,
          "end": 38.18,
          "en": "that might make sense for a title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.18,
          "end": 41.29,
          "en": "and we can give it a certain color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.29,
          "end": 43.29,
          "en": "The color is up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.29,
          "end": 46.68,
          "en": "but here I want to use a yellowish color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.68,
          "end": 48.19,
          "en": "and I'll use the yellow color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.19,
          "end": 50.28,
          "en": "I have here in the start game screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.28,
          "end": 51.973,
          "en": "So I will assign that here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.45,
          "end": 57.13,
          "en": "Now with that assigned, we can go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.13,
          "end": 60.563,
          "en": "and add our style here, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.41,
          "end": 64.46,
          "en": "If we do this, this is looking better",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.46,
          "end": 66.66,
          "en": "but I'd also like to center it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 66.66,
          "end": 71.253,
          "en": "So I'm also going to add text align center,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.09,
          "end": 76.793,
          "en": "and maybe we ramp up the font size even more to 24 pixels.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.13,
          "end": 80.23,
          "en": "And this looks better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 81.25,
          "end": 84.21000000000001,
          "en": "Now, what I want to add in addition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 84.21000000000001,
          "end": 89.21000000000001,
          "en": "is I want to add a little border around this title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 89.4,
          "end": 91.61,
          "en": "and I also wanna add some padding therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 91.61,
          "end": 93.28,
          "en": "so that we have some distance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.28,
          "end": 95.88300000000001,
          "en": "between the border and the actual text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.77000000000001,
          "end": 100.27000000000001,
          "en": "So I'll add a border width of two here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.27000000000001,
          "end": 104.693,
          "en": "and a border color, of that same yellow as I had it before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.07,
          "end": 108.64,
          "en": "And last but not least I want to add some padding here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.64,
          "end": 111.083,
          "en": "in all directions of let's say 12.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.77000000000001,
          "end": 115.61,
          "en": "And with this I have this kind of title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.61,
          "end": 117.47,
          "en": "Now, of course you can adjust the title",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.47,
          "end": 119.53,
          "en": "to look however you want it to look,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.53,
          "end": 122.24,
          "en": "but I'm quite happy with this result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.24,
          "end": 124.1,
          "en": "By the way, the layout is not final.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 124.1,
          "end": 126.28,
          "en": "We will make sure that this is all pushed down",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.28,
          "end": 128.8,
          "en": "a little bit more in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.8,
          "end": 132.25900000000001,
          "en": "But now we have this title and it's probably fair to assume",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.25900000000001,
          "end": 136.36,
          "en": "that we might be using a title like this quite frequently,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.36,
          "end": 139.24,
          "en": "in our application, maybe on different screens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.24,
          "end": 141.65,
          "en": "but typically with the same styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.65,
          "end": 145.32999999999998,
          "en": "or maybe minor styling differences",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.32999999999998,
          "end": 148.39,
          "en": "and therefore it would make sense to outsource this text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.39,
          "end": 151.12,
          "en": "into a separate reusable component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.12,
          "end": 153.92000000000002,
          "en": "because that is what we typically do in React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 153.92000000000002,
          "end": 157.12,
          "en": "when we do have elements that are used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.12,
          "end": 159.44299999999998,
          "en": "in different places of our app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.75,
          "end": 163.45,
          "en": "So in the components folder I'll add a new file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 163.45,
          "end": 166.61,
          "en": "which I'll name, Title.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 166.61,
          "end": 169.69,
          "en": "And in there, I'll add a component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.69,
          "end": 172.2,
          "en": "which I'll also name, Title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 172.2,
          "end": 174.46,
          "en": "Which I'll of course export as always",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.25,
          "end": 178.74,
          "en": "and the job of this component is to display",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.74,
          "end": 180.793,
          "en": "such a configurable title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 181.7,
          "end": 183.86,
          "en": "So we can grab this text here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.86,
          "end": 186.46,
          "en": "from the game screen and cut it from there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 186.46,
          "end": 189.863,
          "en": "and add it here as a returned JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.1,
          "end": 194.5,
          "en": "Of course for this to work, we need to import text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.5,
          "end": 199.5,
          "en": "from React Native here in this Title.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.7,
          "end": 203,
          "en": "and the text here, should of course not be set in stone.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203,
          "end": 204.28,
          "en": "Instead I'll remove it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 204.28,
          "end": 206.96,
          "en": "and I'll use object destructuring here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 206.96,
          "end": 210.751,
          "en": "to pull the children property out of my incoming props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 210.751,
          "end": 214.63,
          "en": "and use that here, so that the actual content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.63,
          "end": 216.94,
          "en": "that is displayed by the title,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 216.94,
          "end": 219.54,
          "en": "can be set by adding it between the opening",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 219.54,
          "end": 222.463,
          "en": "and closing text of my custom title component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 224.29,
          "end": 226.27,
          "en": "And now in GameScreen.js we can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 226.27,
          "end": 228.56,
          "en": "this custom title component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 228.56,
          "end": 230.21,
          "en": "Of course, for this you must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 230.21,
          "end": 231.59300000000002,
          "en": "that it's being imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 232.57,
          "end": 236.28300000000002,
          "en": "And then here we can output opponents guests like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 237.7,
          "end": 241.68,
          "en": "Now for this all to work we also must migrate our styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 241.68,
          "end": 244.25,
          "en": "and we can therefore cut the title style",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.25,
          "end": 247.833,
          "en": "from the game screen and move it into the title component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 249.17,
          "end": 253.14,
          "en": "There of course we must import style sheet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 254.95,
          "end": 259.013,
          "en": "and create our styles via style sheet create,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 260.351,
          "end": 262.653,
          "en": "like this, adding the title property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 263.71,
          "end": 265.77,
          "en": "With all of that, if we save everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 265.77,
          "end": 269.36,
          "en": "we got the same title as before and nothing changed here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 269.36,
          "end": 271.85,
          "en": "but we have this reusable component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 271.85,
          "end": 275.203,
          "en": "which we could use in different parts of our application.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
